        "text": "Editor’s note (October 21, 2026): Rewrote the changelog for clarity and added imagery. There’s been a recent flood of malware attacks that exploit systems at package installation time. Agents and… The post GitHub package firewall in public preview appeared first on The GitHub Blog .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-20-github-package-firewall-in-public-preview",
