      },
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "GitHub package firewall in public preview - GitHub Changelog",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-20-github-package-firewall-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:11:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:12.546Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Editor&rsquo;s note (October 21, 2026): Rewrote the changelog for clarity and added imagery.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-20-github-package-firewall-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:11:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:12.546Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To stem this tide, GitHub is introducing a new package firewall, which sits between endpoints or internal registries and the upstream package repositories.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-20-github-package-firewall-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:11:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:12.546Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The firewall inspects both metadata requests and package downloads for signs of malicious activity, acting as an install-time policy gate.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-20-github-package-firewall-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:11:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:12.546Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The package firewall is available today in public preview for all GitHub Enterprise Cloud customers, including data-resident GitHub Enterprise Cloud.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-20-github-package-firewall-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:11:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:12.546Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The controls available today include a configurable cooldown period, checking the GitHub Advisory Database for malware or vulnerability advisories, and supply-chain checks like attestation downgrades.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-20-github-package-firewall-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:11:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:12.546Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Then, endpoints like coding agents and CI/CD hosts use the firewall for their requests instead of pointing directly at the upstream package registries.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-20-github-package-firewall-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:11:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:12.546Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Metadata requests for package lists as well as the actual package downloads flow through the firewall, which evaluates them against the policy.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-20-github-package-firewall-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:11:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:12.546Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "If a package is blocked erroneously, the user can request an exception with a workflow similar to other GitHub Advanced Security features.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-20-github-package-firewall-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:11:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:12.546Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The package firewall is available in public preview as we scale up the infrastructure behind it and continue to add features based on customer demand.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-20-github-package-firewall-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:11:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:12.546Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "It is available to GitHub Enterprise Cloud customers, including GitHub Enterprise Cloud with data residency.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-20-github-package-firewall-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:11:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:12.546Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The service is free while in the preview period.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-20-github-package-firewall-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:11:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T00:39:12.546Z"
      }
